1
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:26,680
[A Splendid Match]

2
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,760
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:30,039 --> 00:01:31,190
Mrs. He.

4
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,479
Everyone is waiting for you.

5
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,150
Hurry up.

6
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:34,120
-Hurry.
-I…

7
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:38,160
Then I shall make a fool of myself.

8
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:37,870
[Xiang Minghui, He Wenxin's wife]

9
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,310
Hurry up and go.

10
00:01:39,430 --> 00:01:40,400
Just for you,

11
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,600
I'll add another 100 taels to the prize.

12
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,150
Which lord

13
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:55,820
would do us the honor
of stepping into the arena for a match?

14
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:23,280
Then I...

15
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,790
will reluctantly give it a try.

16
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:48,380
Lord Chen hit 5 out of 5,

17
00:02:48,470 --> 00:02:50,450
and Mrs. He hit 2 out of 5.

18
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,630
Lord Chen wins!

19
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,920
Total prize money,

20
00:02:54,950 --> 00:02:56,240
1,000 taels!

21
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,330
Brother Wenxiu is up!

22
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,150
Yanying.

23
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,710
Where did your third brother

24
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:21,710
learn archery?

25
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,150
He learned it from the guards

26
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,670
when he was young.

27
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,150
But he must have mastered it after working

28
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:27,610
at the government office.

29
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:42,390
Lord Chen hit all 5 shots.

30
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:46,070
Young Master Yao hit 3.

31
00:03:46,370 --> 00:03:47,710
Total prize money,

32
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:50,220
1,500 taels!

33
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:52,240
He won another round?

34
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,520
Yanying, it's your turn.

35
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,630
Lord Chen wins again!

36
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,430
Total prize money,

37
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,120
2,000 taels!

38
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:36,870
Hya!

39
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,190
Didn't you say you could win?

40
00:04:44,190 --> 00:04:45,750
He usually let me win.

41
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,430
Why didn't he today?

42
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,390
Watch me defeat him.

43
00:05:09,550 --> 00:05:10,150
Miss Xue,

44
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:10,950
please.

45
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,580
Please.

46
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,040
Hya!

47
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,400
Hya!

48
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,600
He missed?

49
00:05:33,990 --> 00:05:35,290
How is that possible?

50
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:50,940
What is my third brother doing?

51
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:56,550
How could Jiuheng drop the ball?

52
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,410
Lord Chen hit the bullseye twice

53
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,000
and missed 3 times.

54
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:13,880
Miss Xue hit the target all 5 times.

55
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,950
Round one,

56
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,870
-Hya!
-Miss Xue wins.

57
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,140
What is wrong with Yanyun?

58
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:21,430
He's clearly throwing the match

59
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,630
to let Miss Xue win.

60
00:06:22,750 --> 00:06:24,240
But I clearly told him

61
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,480
that Qinglan hates it
when people let her win.

62
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,040
What?

63
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,630
You told him that?

64
00:06:28,630 --> 00:06:29,520
Yes.

65
00:06:31,430 --> 00:06:33,159
Could he be doing it on purpose?

66
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:36,530
Qinglan is definitely going to be angry.

67
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:02,870
Why did you stop shooting, Miss Xue?

68
00:07:04,390 --> 00:07:05,790
How could you miss again?

69
00:07:06,510 --> 00:07:07,970
I am out of practice.

70
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,920
After shooting so many times in a row,

71
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,050
I got a little tired.

72
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:19,160
I am done competing.

73
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:19,870
I yield.

74
00:07:30,950 --> 00:07:32,390
Why bother, Miss Xue?

75
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,100
You are obviously letting me win.

76
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,159
By doing that,

77
00:07:36,159 --> 00:07:37,610
you're looking down on me.

78
00:07:37,610 --> 00:07:38,360
Since you look down on me,

79
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:40,090
what's the point of competing?

80
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,480
I'm not competing anymore.

81
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:41,950
Hya!

82
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:48,290
Qinglan has quite a short temper.

83
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,100
I'm afraid Jiuheng

84
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,550
[Dong Peiqin, Wang Xuanfan's wife]

85
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:51,730
will suffer in the future.

86
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,270
This child.

87
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:54,750
Jiuheng was letting her win.

88
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:56,690
[Dai Yuzhu, Fu Hailian's wife]

89
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,950
Why did she get angry?

90
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,190
Master,

91
00:07:58,430 --> 00:07:59,690
please don't be angry.

92
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,060
I'll talk to her later.

93
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:05,240
No need.

94
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,380
Since they are not meant to be,

95
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:10,360
don't force it.

96
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,360
Your third brother
deliberately let me win.

97
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,070
So boring.

98
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:27,690
Qinglan, don't be mad.

99
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,190
My third brother
has always been a gentleman.

100
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:29,630
It's inevitable that...

101
00:08:29,630 --> 00:08:30,690
He is your brother.

102
00:08:33,669 --> 00:08:34,270
Forget it.

103
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,960
I don't want to talk about it.

104
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:38,320
Just seeing

105
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,510
his arrogant look

106
00:08:39,909 --> 00:08:40,840
makes me angry.

107
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,240
Let me try.

108
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:50,600
Really?

109
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,210
Great.

110
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,720
If you can win,

111
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,200
I'll add another 500 taels to the prize.

112
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,320
Then you'd better get the money ready.

113
00:08:59,320 --> 00:08:59,750
Okay.

114
00:09:08,470 --> 00:09:09,680
This Miss Gu

115
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,890
is quite something.

116
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,120
I didn't expect Miss Xue

117
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,120
to be so special

118
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,120
to you.

119
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,680
I have never seen you

120
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,320
give in to someone like this.

121
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,880
I was worried you wouldn't play.

122
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,000
Why?

123
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,770
You want to give in to me too?

124
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:33,150
You are one of us.

125
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:35,490
There's no need to give in.

126
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:47,270
Yanying?

127
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:48,510
Come and sit here,

128
00:09:48,510 --> 00:09:49,390
so you can see clearly.

129
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,240
-Okay.
-Come.

130
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:53,790
Hya!

131
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:15,620
Lord Chen hit all 5 shots.

132
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:18,580
Miss Gu hit all 5 shots.

133
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,140
The first round...

134
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:21,150
is a tie!

135
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,890
Impressive!

136
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:25,580
[Wang Zan, son of Wang Shenzhi,
Minister of the Court of Judicial Review]

137
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,060
What is her name again?

138
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,190
Young Master,

139
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,570
his name is Chen Yanyun.

140
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,150
How could I not know Third Mr. Chen?

141
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:34,630
I was asking about the girl.

142
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,090
Go find out her name for me.

143
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,390
If you find out,

144
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,520
you will be rewarded.

145
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:40,600
Right away.

146
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,040
Excellent archery.

147
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,270
It's okay.

148
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,360
My mentor wants to set me up

149
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,720
with Miss Xue.

150
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,600
I couldn't refuse.

151
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:56,510
So I found some

152
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:57,370
indirect ways.

153
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:58,720
But don't worry.

154
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,840
Nothing will ever happen

155
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:01,550
between us.

156
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,810
You're deliberately trying
to mess with my mind.

157
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:10,750
Hya!

158
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:12,840
Be careful.

159
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,120
Round two.

160
00:11:22,710 --> 00:11:25,480
♪ The sharpness
that blooms as I cross the waves alone ♪

161
00:11:26,250 --> 00:11:27,270
♪ The direction
is held entirely in my own hands ♪

162
00:11:28,090 --> 00:11:29,110
♪ Yet I let
this boundless stretch of sea ♪

163
00:11:29,850 --> 00:11:32,650
♪ Create the dawn of reaching the shore ♪

164
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:35,040
♪ All things grow as they pass through
the wind and waves ♪

165
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:37,180
♪ Even in moments
of deep uncertainty ♪

166
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,500
♪ Soothing the wounds
left by the turbulence ♪

167
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:44,000
♪ The silhouette of sails pierces
the mist held high ♪

168
00:11:44,810 --> 00:11:48,160
♪ There is strength to voyage far ♪

169
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,820
Lord Chen hit 5 out of 5.

170
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:53,030
Miss Gu hit 5 out of 5.

171
00:11:51,490 --> 00:11:53,170
♪ In every chant sung
upon leaving the harbor ♪

172
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:54,550
Round two...

173
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:54,880
♪ Only through awakening
does the light appear ♪

174
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,080
is a tie.

175
00:11:55,710 --> 00:11:58,240
♪ I alone am my own direction ♪

176
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,720
Two ties in a row?

177
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,750
It's rare to see a third round.

178
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:02,030
Ruixiang.

179
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:05,560
Add another 100 taels to the prize.

180
00:12:05,670 --> 00:12:06,440
Shout it out

181
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,970
so others will add to it too.

182
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:08,670
Yes.

183
00:12:09,050 --> 00:12:10,780
I'll add another 100 taels too.

184
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:17,300
Eldest Miss Xue
added 100 taels to the prize.

185
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,770
Sixth Miss Chen
added 100 taels to the prize.

186
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:23,240
Madam Fu added 200 taels

187
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:25,470
to the prize.

188
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,480
Madam Wang added 200 taels

189
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,630
to the prize.

190
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,040
Madam He added 100 taels...

191
00:12:32,070 --> 00:12:33,000
How did you make that horse

192
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,660
-recognize me?
-To the prize.

193
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,790
You always use sweet osmanthus incense.

194
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,550
After returning from Tongzhou,

195
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:39,200
I had

196
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,960
the groom for the Yuhuacong horse

197
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,550
scent his clothes
with sweet osmanthus incense

198
00:12:42,550 --> 00:12:43,360
every day.

199
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:45,280
This horse is smart.

200
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,680
It didn't let me down.

201
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,460
You really put a lot of thought into this.

202
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:55,910
Did you

203
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,600
think it over later?

204
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,050
I have thought about it.

205
00:13:04,610 --> 00:13:05,740
If others marry you,

206
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,120
they can become the wife
of a Grand Secretary

207
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,580
and gain wealth and glory.

208
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,300
But I am different.

209
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:12,450
I don't lack money,

210
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:13,720
and I don't want

211
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:16,080
to gain wealth through marriage.

212
00:13:17,030 --> 00:13:18,550
After becoming a titled lady,

213
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:19,610
every move of mine

214
00:13:19,910 --> 00:13:21,310
will be judged by others.

215
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:22,510
And I must strictly follow the rules

216
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,310
of feminine conduct and virtue.

217
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:26,790
So I thought for a long time,

218
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:28,240
and I still couldn't figure out

219
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,040
what benefits

220
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,720
marrying you would bring me.

221
00:13:31,910 --> 00:13:33,110
It's the same for you.

222
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,050
Marrying me

223
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:35,870
won't do you any good either.

224
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:37,430
You are wrong about that.

225
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,360
Perhaps

226
00:13:38,910 --> 00:13:40,770
marrying me won't do you any good,

227
00:13:41,270 --> 00:13:42,200
but marrying you

228
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,390
would benefit me a lot.

229
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,030
How so?

230
00:13:47,550 --> 00:13:48,240
Look.

231
00:13:49,150 --> 00:13:50,320
Everyone in court knows

232
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,780
I am my mentor's disciple.

233
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:52,630
If I marry

234
00:13:52,630 --> 00:13:54,030
the woman he chose for me,

235
00:13:54,750 --> 00:13:55,390
wouldn't that make me

236
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:57,650
a full-fledged member of the Fu faction,

237
00:13:57,910 --> 00:13:59,080
tied down for life?

238
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:01,600
But actually,

239
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:04,330
I don't want to take sides yet.

240
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,970
Don't say that here.

241
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:11,670
Don't worry. They can't hear us.

242
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,870
The situation in the court is changing,

243
00:14:13,870 --> 00:14:15,530
and everyone is changing too.

244
00:14:15,870 --> 00:14:16,750
Instead of

245
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:19,120
tying my marriage to my stance

246
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,270
for the next few decades

247
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:21,960
now,

248
00:14:22,630 --> 00:14:23,360
I'd rather

249
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,670
marry a woman
who doesn't represent any side

250
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:27,840
and whom

251
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,630
I can completely trust.

252
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,400
And it just so happens

253
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:33,550
that she's very rich.

254
00:14:35,630 --> 00:14:36,630
It just so happens

255
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,600
that I really like this woman.

256
00:14:44,790 --> 00:14:46,870
I'm just very lucky.

257
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,810
You really have a lot of nerve
saying that.

258
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,650
There's one more thing.

259
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,440
It just so happens...

260
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,420
that this woman...

261
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:09,510
also likes me.

262
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,870
The third round of the competition
is about to begin.

263
00:15:16,870 --> 00:15:19,240
Lord Chen, Miss Gu,

264
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,640
please come to the arena.

265
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,520
Young Master,

266
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:30,330
I found out.

267
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,600
Her name is Gu Jinzhao.

268
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:33,320
She is Lord Gu Deyuan's niece.

269
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,510
Jinzhao?

270
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,240
Good.

271
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,120
If she wins,

272
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,670
I will go compete with her.

273
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:42,470
Young Master.

274
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:44,030
What if this Miss Gu...

275
00:15:44,030 --> 00:15:44,960
loses?

276
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,120
Loses?

277
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,760
Then I'll defeat Third Mr. Chen!

278
00:15:49,870 --> 00:15:50,750
And avenge her.

279
00:15:50,750 --> 00:15:52,550
You are very wise, Young Master.

280
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:54,720
Take it.

281
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:57,200
Thank you, Young Master.

282
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,810
Round three!

283
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:02,570
♪ The sharpness
that blooms as I cross the waves alone ♪

284
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:01,320
Hya!

285
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,030
Hya!

286
00:16:03,340 --> 00:16:04,430
♪ The direction
is held entirely in my own hands ♪

287
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:06,340
♪ Yet I let
this boundless stretch of sea ♪

288
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:09,780
♪ Create the dawn of reaching the shore ♪

289
