00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:15,000
-Hya!
-Hya!

314
00:17:16,069 --> 00:17:17,349
-Hya!
-Hya!

315
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,069
The Penal Court is handling a case!

316
00:17:20,069 --> 00:17:21,640
-Unauthorized persons, step aside!
-Gu Jinzhao.

317
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,640
