318
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:27,440
-Hya!
-Hya!

319
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:28,550
Hya!

320
00:17:29,270 --> 00:17:32,200
-Hya!
-Hya!

321
00:17:33,790 --> 00:17:34,850
[Outing]

322
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:36,960
-Hya!
-Hya!

323
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:38,350
Hya!

324
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,400
-Hya!
-Hya!

325
00:17:50,350 --> 00:17:51,750
The Penal Court
is arresting a major criminal.

326
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:52,410
Step aside!

327
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:54,480
The constables of the Penal Court?

328
00:17:54,830 --> 00:17:56,000
Why are they here?

329
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:23,680
Arrest them!

330
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,160
Honey.

331
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:37,160
Let's go!

332
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:37,590
Madam!

333
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:38,350
How impudent!

334
00:18:38,350 --> 00:18:38,680
Move!

335
00:18:38,790 --> 00:18:39,310
How impudent!

336
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:40,790
I am an Imperial Court official!

337
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:42,310
Director of the Ministry of Justice!

338
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:43,350
How dare the Penal Court

339
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:45,150
act with such insubordination!

340
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:47,200
I demand to see His Majesty!

341
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:48,400
Move!

342
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,040
Kneel!

343
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:00,130
Who did they arrest?

344
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:01,160
Xuanweng,

345
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:04,440
it's Du Wangfa,
Director of the Ministry of Justice.

346
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,470
Who's leading the action?

347
00:19:05,470 --> 00:19:06,400
Is it Zhang Ling?

348
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:08,050
It's not Commander Zhang.

349
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:08,720
It's...

350
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:10,430
Young Master Ye.

351
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:19,290
My Lord,

352
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,480
we arrested them.

353
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,020
Take them back.

354
00:20:23,070 --> 00:20:23,440
Yes.

355
00:20:24,160 --> 00:20:24,640
Take them away!

356
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,000
Move!

357
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,400
Let go of me!

358
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,720
I am an Imperial Court official!

359
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:30,800
Let go!

360
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:33,030
Hold on!

361
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,110
On today's Spring Outing,

362
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,350
all the guests
are important court officials

363
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:42,160
and their families.

364
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,960
How dare you cause trouble here?

365
00:20:45,270 --> 00:20:45,930
Who are you?

366
00:20:47,070 --> 00:20:47,830
Xue Qinglan,

367
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,460
one of the hosts today.

368
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,810
Then you are harboring a wanted criminal.

369
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:57,920
Do you want to end up
in the Penal Court's prison too?

370
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:58,650
How dare you!

371
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,530
Why wouldn't I dare?

372
00:21:01,110 --> 00:21:02,370
If you can't accept it,

373
00:21:02,510 --> 00:21:04,480
tell your old man
to complain at the Golden Celestial Hall.

374
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,080
Stop!

375
00:21:12,680 --> 00:21:14,210
Don't rely on your numbers.

376
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:15,480
If you have the guts,

377
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,640
fight me in a real battle.

378
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,160
Fight?

379
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:23,490
The Penal Court never fights.

380
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:25,770
We either arrest people

381
00:21:26,810 --> 00:21:27,690
or kill them.

382
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:36,970
Let's go!

383
00:21:42,710 --> 00:21:43,840
Don't act rashly!

384
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:46,420
None of the ministers made a move.

385
00:21:46,420 --> 00:21:48,080
Why are you acting on impulse?

386
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:50,280
They have gone too far.

387
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:52,400
I heard that Ye Xian

388
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,520
is a madman.

389
00:21:53,790 --> 00:21:54,790
He might actually

390
00:21:54,790 --> 00:21:56,640
arrest you
and put you in the imperial prison.

391
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:58,840
You'll be the one who suffers in the end.

392
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,000
A madman?

393
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:08,170
Then we'll have to see about that.

394
00:22:14,590 --> 00:22:15,110
What?

395
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:19,410
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

396
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:16,960
Zhao

397
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:19,160
actually defeated Lord Chen?

398
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,730
Lord Chen let her win.

399
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,630
You have no idea.

400
00:22:23,790 --> 00:22:25,450
He had won 3 times in a row.

401
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:27,280
He must have felt embarrassed.

402
00:22:27,350 --> 00:22:28,200
Starting with Xue Qinglan,

403
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,400
he began to hold back.

404
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,720
Who would have expected that Xue Qinglan

405
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,920
would be so ungrateful?

406
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:33,680
She actually threw her arrows
on the ground

407
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:34,550
and refused to let him hold back.

408
00:22:34,550 --> 00:22:36,270
And that's how it became Zhao's turn.

409
00:22:36,270 --> 00:22:37,200
In that case,

410
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,920
Zhao shouldn't have won.

411
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,510
Even Xue Qinglan,

412
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,400
given her status,

413
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:44,790
was willing to yield.

414
00:22:45,790 --> 00:22:47,190
The girls from our family

415
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,590
should be more modest.

416
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:55,640
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

417
00:22:52,790 --> 00:22:53,590
I heard yesterday

418
00:22:53,590 --> 00:22:54,650
that Xian also came

419
00:22:54,790 --> 00:22:55,960
and arrested someone.

420
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:56,510
Yes, yes.

421
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:57,920
Xian suddenly

422
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,270
brought the constables of the Penal Court

423
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:00,110
and rushed in.

424
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:01,030
He insisted on

425
00:23:01,030 --> 00:23:02,440
arresting Director Du
of the Ministry of Justice and his family

426
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,400
on the spot.

427
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,300
Wenxiu said

428
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:07,610
he had never seen an arrest like that.

429
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:09,070
I don't know

430
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,350
what happened to Xian.

431
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:12,880
He's a completely different person now.

432
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,550
Quite scary.

433
00:23:15,110 --> 00:23:16,570
What's so scary about him?

434
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:32,470
I heard

435
00:23:32,510 --> 00:23:32,880
everyone

436
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:34,480
was talking here at Old Madam's place.

437
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,810
I'm here to join the fun.

438
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:37,590
Lian,

439
00:23:38,030 --> 00:23:39,230
what were you saying?

440
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,200
What did Xian do

441
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,400
to make you so scared?

442
00:23:44,270 --> 00:23:45,240
Nothing.

443
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:47,440
It's just that Xian

444
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:49,440
brought the constables of the Penal Court

445
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,680
to the Spring Outing

446
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:53,650
and arrested Director Du
of the Ministry of Justice.

447
00:23:54,070 --> 00:23:56,070
I thought it was something serious.

448
00:23:56,110 --> 00:23:57,510
The Penal Court arrests people

449
00:23:57,510 --> 00:23:58,960
under His Majesty's orders.

450
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:00,310
If His Majesty
tells him to make an arrest,

451
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,640
let alone the Spring Outing,

452
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:02,590
even at the Luming Banquet,

453
00:24:02,590 --> 00:24:03,750
he still has to do it.

454
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:05,860
What's there to make a fuss about?

455
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:08,720
Yes.

456
00:24:10,030 --> 00:24:11,560
I heard from people outside

457
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:13,160
that the Grand Secretary

458
00:24:13,350 --> 00:24:14,400
intended to play matchmaker for Lord Chen

459
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:15,590
and Xue Qinglan.

460
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:17,770
That's why he held this Spring Outing.

461
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,790
That's what they say.

462
00:24:20,750 --> 00:24:22,680
That would be a powerful alliance.

463
00:24:23,070 --> 00:24:23,930
The Chen family

464
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:26,240
may be a noble family for generations,

465
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:27,440
but the Xue family

466
00:24:27,570 --> 00:24:28,800
has also been a top civil-official family

467
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:30,720
since the founding of the state,

468
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:33,720
and they're in-laws
with the Grand Secretary.

469
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:34,590
Looks like

470
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:35,750
Lord Chen

471
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:37,490
is just a few steps away

472
00:24:37,590 --> 00:24:39,320
from soaring to great heights.

473
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:42,680
Zhao.

474
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:45,590
I heard your maternal grandmother

475
00:24:45,590 --> 00:24:47,200
has been following the Chen family

476
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,510
for over ten years.

477
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,160
Businessmen

478
00:24:52,590 --> 00:24:54,750
are best at speculation,

479
00:24:55,790 --> 00:24:57,720
and she clearly has good judgment.

480
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:01,270
My grandmother

481
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,550
didn't just bet on

482
00:25:02,550 --> 00:25:04,010
the Chen family back then—

483
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:05,590
she also placed high hopes

484
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:06,830
on our Gu family,

485
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,240
which is why she married my mother off

486
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,240
to my father.

487
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,580
And the result?

488
00:25:14,750 --> 00:25:15,950
It seems her judgment

489
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:17,220
is sometimes accurate

490
00:25:17,510 --> 00:25:18,570
and sometimes not.

491
00:25:20,550 --> 00:25:22,110
If you ask me,

492
00:25:22,270 --> 00:25:23,310
I don't think

493
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,400
Xue Qinglan is really

494
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:25,960
a good match for Chen Yanyun.

495
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,550
She was previously engaged,

496
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:29,080
and her fiancé passed away.

497
00:25:29,270 --> 00:25:31,600
Chen Yanyun has also been married before.

498
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,110
Really?

499
00:25:33,510 --> 00:25:35,550
How can it be the same?

500
00:25:36,070 --> 00:25:37,800
If a man has been married,

501
00:25:37,830 --> 00:25:39,110
he can marry again.

502
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,500
But if a woman has been betrothed,

503
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:44,160
she is considered flawed.

504
00:25:45,550 --> 00:25:46,350
That's true.

505
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:49,030
Not to mention
that her fiancé passed away—

506
00:25:49,030 --> 00:25:50,480
even divorce

507
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,680
is looked down upon

508
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,160
and despised.

509
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:56,160
So what?

510
00:25:56,510 --> 00:25:58,440
You can't judge a book by its cover.

511
00:25:58,510 --> 00:26:00,070
Living a good life for yourself

512
00:26:00,070 --> 00:26:01,350
is better than suffering in silence

513
00:26:01,350 --> 00:26:02,590
to save face

514
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:04,120
and keep up appearances.

515
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:16,680
Zhao.

516
00:26:18,790 --> 00:26:19,550
Fifth Aunt.

517
00:26:23,550 --> 00:26:25,240
You were like a firecracker today,

518
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:27,480
getting all fired up as you were talking.

519
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:28,880
They came at me first.

520
00:26:29,830 --> 00:26:31,510
It's one thing to talk about me,

521
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:34,110
but bringing up
my maternal family crosses the line.

522
00:26:34,110 --> 00:26:35,640
I had to hit back

523
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:37,360
so it won't happen again.

524
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,820
Weren't you the same, Fifth Aunt?

525
00:26:40,230 --> 00:26:41,230
It was different.

526
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:43,200
When they spoke ill of Xian,

527
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:44,310
no matter how angry I was,

528
00:26:44,310 --> 00:26:44,880
I could only

529
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:45,940
take it out on Lian.

530
00:26:47,070 --> 00:26:47,920
Fifth Aunt,

531
00:26:48,030 --> 00:26:49,440
you were just thinking about Fifth Uncle

532
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,640
and Hui.

533
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:53,170
You weren't really afraid of anyone.

534
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:56,600
Drop by my courtyard when you have time.

535
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,160
This Zhao.

536
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:09,750
I finally understand

537
00:27:09,750 --> 00:27:10,400
why Xian

538
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,480
likes her so much.

539
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,030
So why don't you

540
00:27:14,030 --> 00:27:15,350
grant Xian's wish?

541
00:27:17,350 --> 00:27:18,160
I can't.

542
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:21,170
The Imperial Court suppresses
the military nobility.

543
00:27:21,170 --> 00:27:21,790
Look at how they

544
00:27:21,790 --> 00:27:22,750
treat me,

545
00:27:23,310 --> 00:27:24,160
and you'll know how weak

546
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:26,220
the Marquis's household has become.

547
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:28,350
Our only plan now

548
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:31,440
is for Xian to make a good match,

549
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,720
so that we'll have a glimmer of hope.

550
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:36,830
They're all snobs.

551
00:27:37,270 --> 00:27:38,200
When they came
to ask for my hand in marriage back then,

552
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:39,750
they were so humble.

553
00:27:46,590 --> 00:27:47,350
My Lady.

554
00:27:47,590 --> 00:27:48,480
Isn't Young Master Yao

555
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:49,270
Miss Lian's

556
00:27:49,270 --> 00:27:50,310
future husband?

557
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:53,160
Why did he give you a hairpin in private?

558
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,590
This Yao Wenxiu

559
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,440
is no good.

560
00:27:58,720 --> 00:27:59,240
Well,

561
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:01,350
should we tell Miss Lian?

562
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:02,790
Of course not.

563
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:04,110
How could I say it?

564
00:28:04,110 --> 00:28:05,910
That Yao Wenxiu is hitting on me?

565
00:28:06,160 --> 00:28:07,760
My situation in this mansion

566
00:28:07,830 --> 00:28:09,490
is already difficult enough.

567
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:12,480
Then this hairpin...

568
00:28:15,030 --> 00:28:15,830
Hide it.

569
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,690
Pretend it never happened.

570
00:28:18,920 --> 00:28:19,920
Yes, My Lady.

571
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:24,730
Sili Hutong was better.

572
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:26,720
Although the Eldest Miss is fierce,

573
00:28:26,720 --> 00:28:27,830
she doesn't make trouble.

574
00:28:27,830 --> 00:28:28,970
Unlike here.

575
00:28:28,990 --> 00:28:30,320
Miss Lan always...

576
00:28:32,110 --> 00:28:32,920
Alright.

577
00:28:33,590 --> 00:28:34,980
What's the point of

578
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:36,570
talking about this now?

579
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:49,510
You reap

580
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,350
what you sow.

581
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,830
In the future,

582
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:56,090
