586
00:29:09,470 --> 00:29:11,390
[Good Weather for the Crops]

587
00:29:17,530 --> 00:29:19,020
At this Spring Outing,

588
00:29:19,140 --> 00:29:20,230
all the noble ladies,

589
00:29:20,230 --> 00:29:22,540
from 18 to 80,

590
00:29:22,830 --> 00:29:24,290
were competing in beauty.

591
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:25,590
For a

592
00:29:25,590 --> 00:29:27,160
unique embroidery pattern,

593
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:28,750
they were willing to spend a lot of money.

594
00:29:28,750 --> 00:29:29,350
What do you

595
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:31,100
think this means?

596
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:32,490
Indeed.

597
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:34,350
This year, the rouge

598
00:29:34,350 --> 00:29:35,750
and silk shops are doing more than

599
00:29:35,750 --> 00:29:37,680
50% better than in previous years.

600
00:29:37,830 --> 00:29:38,400
Right.

601
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:39,480
So,

602
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:41,450
that means people have got money.

603
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,480
I plan to turn Linxia Restaurant into

604
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:45,350
