607
00:29:48,510 --> 00:29:49,840
and watch operas there.

608
00:29:50,070 --> 00:29:51,550
In short, it only serves female guests.

609
00:29:51,550 --> 00:29:53,350
Male guests are not allowed inside.

610
00:29:53,350 --> 00:29:54,270
Didn't you say earlier

611
00:29:54,270 --> 00:29:55,920
that you were going to Shanxi?

612
00:29:55,920 --> 00:29:56,640
Why are you suddenly interested

613
00:29:56,640 --> 00:29:58,070
