614
00:29:58,070 --> 00:29:59,680
Even if I'm going to Shanxi,

615
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:00,880
the businesses in the capital

616
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,410
can still operate as usual.

617
00:30:04,070 --> 00:30:04,720
Alright.

618
00:30:05,030 --> 00:30:06,230
I'll head back first.

619
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:13,590
My Lady,

620
00:30:13,750 --> 00:30:14,830
