622
00:30:16,310 --> 00:30:17,510
I haven't made up my mind yet.

623
00:30:17,510 --> 00:30:18,960
It's just that being prepared
for everything

624
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:20,420
makes me feel more at ease.

625
00:30:20,550 --> 00:30:21,480
Linxia Restaurant

626
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:23,350
