half a backup plan for me.

627
00:30:23,350 --> 00:30:24,070
Gu!

628
00:30:26,550 --> 00:30:27,790
Who are you?

629
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:32,310
I am Wang Zan.

630
00:30:33,550 --> 00:30:36,240
My father is
the Minister of the Court of Judicial...

631
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:36,830
Review.

632
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,680
Greetings, Mr. Wang.

633
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:42,070
May I ask what brings you here?

634
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:43,680
Yesterday during the archery contest,

635
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:45,000
it was almost my turn,

636
00:30:45,070 --> 00:30:46,160
but that Ye Xian

637
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,180
ruined it for me.

638
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:49,240
It kept me awake all night.

639
00:30:49,830 --> 00:30:50,720
But today,

640
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,160
I ran into you as soon as I walked out.

641
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:54,240
It seems my dream has really come true.

642
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,070
I have an manor

643
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:56,680
with a ready-made training ground.

644
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:58,350
There's no time like the present.

645
00:30:58,350 --> 00:31:00,200
How about we go there and have a match?

646
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,940
Mr. Wang, you must be joking.

647
00:31:02,110 --> 00:31:03,030
I have some things to do.

648
00:31:03,030 --> 00:31:03,960
I must go now.

649
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:04,750
Don't.

650
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:06,000
You are just a girl.

651
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,240
What could you possibly have to do?

652
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,310
Just have a match with me.

653
00:31:08,310 --> 00:31:09,710
I'll feel bad if we don't.

654
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:12,400
If you really want a match,

655
00:31:12,430 --> 00:31:13,790
