656
00:31:13,790 --> 00:31:14,450
The next...

657
00:31:14,790 --> 00:31:16,270
The next Spring Outing?

658
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:17,720
Wouldn't that be next year?

659
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:18,200
No.

660
00:31:20,330 --> 00:31:22,510
You just don't want to have a match
with me, do you?

661
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:24,110
That's fine. How about this?

662
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,550
I'll treat you to a meal.

663
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:26,440
At Linxia Restaurant—

664
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:28,310
the finest bird's nest
and shark fin banquet.

665
00:31:28,310 --> 00:31:29,030
Let's go.

666
00:31:29,110 --> 00:31:30,070
Do me a favor.

667
00:31:30,070 --> 00:31:31,130
