668
00:31:31,240 --> 00:31:32,030
Where did this maid come from?

669
00:31:32,030 --> 00:31:32,870
Get out of the way.

670
00:31:32,870 --> 00:31:34,020
Let's go.

671
00:31:33,450 --> 00:31:39,140
[Baiwei Restaurant]

672
00:31:34,510 --> 00:31:35,570
What are you doing?

673
00:31:36,930 --> 00:31:37,480
What?

674
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,440
