677
00:31:41,550 --> 00:31:42,750
Don't be ungrateful.

678
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,070
I see.

679
00:31:46,590 --> 00:31:47,960
You don't think I'm good enough for you.

680
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:48,960
That makes sense.

681
00:31:49,550 --> 00:31:51,270
You girls nowadays

682
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:53,960
