683
00:31:54,350 --> 00:31:54,960
What?

684
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:56,480
Who caught your eye?

685
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:59,400
Could it be Yao Wenxiu?

686
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:01,750
Are you crazy?

687
00:32:04,360 --> 00:32:05,820
Why are you everywhere?

688
00:32:08,030 --> 00:32:09,400
My Lady, just go.

689
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:10,520
I've got this.

690
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,570
Be gentle! It hurts!

691
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:14,960
Get away!

692
00:32:14,550 --> 00:32:19,120
[Baiwei Restaurant]

693
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:20,000
Gu Jinzhao!

694
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,900
Just you wait!

695
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:26,180
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

696
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,220
Grand Preceptor Xue

697
00:32:25,220 --> 00:32:27,030
came to visit in person yesterday.

698
00:32:27,030 --> 00:32:28,310
He said that Qinglan's personality

699
00:32:28,310 --> 00:32:29,790
is quite different from yours,

700
00:32:29,790 --> 00:32:32,110
and that he fears
you won't get along in the future.

701
00:32:32,110 --> 00:32:33,960
It's not as bad as all that, Madam.

702
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:35,240
It's normal for two people

703
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:36,770
not to click on a blind date.

704
00:32:36,960 --> 00:32:37,790
Besides,

705
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,090
I am a few years older than Miss Xue,

706
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,560
