707
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:43,920
I am indeed not a good match for Miss Xue.

708
00:32:49,500 --> 00:32:50,870
Qinglan was also

709
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:52,640
betrothed before.

710
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:54,530
However, before they could be wed,

711
00:32:54,530 --> 00:32:55,990
the groom died of illness.

712
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:58,110
Lord Xue always feels

713
00:32:58,110 --> 00:32:59,350
he has failed his daughter,

714
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:01,720
so he yields to her in everything.

715
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:03,680
Now, even when he tries to discipline her,

716
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:05,480
he has no control over her at all.

717
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,110
In my opinion,

718
00:33:09,270 --> 00:33:10,550
she's just spoiled.

719
00:33:12,480 --> 00:33:13,160
Later,

720
00:33:13,160 --> 00:33:14,880
I'll look around carefully for you

721
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:16,140
and pick a better girl.

722
00:33:19,400 --> 00:33:20,400
Thank you, Madam.

723
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:22,590
At first, I just thought

724
00:33:22,590 --> 00:33:24,250
Qinglan's family background

725
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:25,810
was a good match for you,

726
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:27,690
but I overlooked other things.

727
00:33:28,550 --> 00:33:29,980
I haven't asked you yet—

728
00:33:30,030 --> 00:33:32,090
what kind of girl are you looking for?

729
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,040
Don't laugh at me, Madam,

730
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:37,200
but since Jiang passed away,

731
00:33:37,200 --> 00:33:38,270
all these years,

732
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:39,750
I've actually

733
00:33:39,850 --> 00:33:41,960
lost interest in marriage.

734
00:33:42,310 --> 00:33:43,910
If I have to remarry,

735
00:33:44,070 --> 00:33:46,260
I'd hope to marry a reasonable

736
00:33:46,350 --> 00:33:48,070
and smart girl.

737
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:59,360
I shall take my leave now.

738
00:34:06,140 --> 00:34:12,389
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

739
00:34:09,110 --> 00:34:10,760
Jiuheng looked like

740
00:34:11,070 --> 00:34:12,590
