741
00:34:15,150 --> 00:34:16,800
You actually believe him?

742
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,370
What do you mean?

743
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,710
From the very beginning, he was against

744
00:34:21,710 --> 00:34:23,360
this match-making.

745
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:26,320
He was just going along with our wishes

746
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:28,320
and playing along with the arrangement.

747
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:30,190
But at the Spring Outing,

748
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:32,060
he deliberately gave in to Qinglan,

749
00:34:32,060 --> 00:34:33,750
intending to anger her

750
00:34:33,790 --> 00:34:35,190
so she would be the one

751
00:34:35,190 --> 00:34:37,110
to call it off.

752
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,070
As for what he said just now

753
00:34:39,070 --> 00:34:40,330
about wanting someone

754
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:42,280
gentle, virtuous,

755
00:34:42,670 --> 00:34:44,340
and reasonable,

756
00:34:44,710 --> 00:34:45,920
his point was that

757
00:34:46,110 --> 00:34:47,440
choosing Qinglan for him

758
00:34:47,440 --> 00:34:48,550
was a mistake.

759
00:34:51,739 --> 00:34:52,510
He really is

760
00:34:52,510 --> 00:34:53,710
so scheming.

761
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:02,860
You want to invest in my business?

762
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,150
This is the money

763
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,750
I've saved up over the years.

764
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,280
I did the math.

765
00:35:13,590 --> 00:35:14,920
It totals 8,000 taels.

766
00:35:16,030 --> 00:35:17,360
I'm giving it all to you.

767
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:19,630
8,000 taels...

768
00:35:19,840 --> 00:35:20,800
