769
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,210
It's not enough.

770
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:24,440
When Second Sister married Yao Wenxiu,

771
00:35:24,440 --> 00:35:26,300
her dowry alone was 20,000 taels.

772
00:35:27,070 --> 00:35:28,590
Even though it somehow

773
00:35:28,710 --> 00:35:30,170
ended up being only 2,000,

774
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:31,510
the going rate for marriages
in the capital

775
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:32,550
