778
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:40,630
You want to earn your own dowry?

779
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:43,440
Yes.

780
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:47,000
My birth mother
is still suffering in the temple.

781
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:48,550
