788
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:00,800
As long as it makes money, it's fine.

789
00:36:03,510 --> 00:36:04,150
No.

790
00:36:10,110 --> 00:36:11,440
Is the money not enough?

791
00:36:12,030 --> 00:36:13,160
I can scrape up more.

792
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,760
It's not about the money.

793
00:36:16,150 --> 00:36:17,550
No matter how much you give me,

794
00:36:17,550 --> 00:36:18,710
I won't agree.

795
00:36:19,630 --> 00:36:20,400
Go back.

796
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:23,320
Why?

797
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:28,240
Zhao,

798
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:30,360
I know you don't like me.

799
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:32,000
But...

800
00:36:32,190 --> 00:36:33,710
