801
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:36,000
Please help me

802
00:36:36,110 --> 00:36:37,190
and let me invest

803
00:36:37,190 --> 00:36:38,190
in your business.

804
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,850
What if you lose your money?

805
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:43,590
Doing business

806
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,590
means you might lose money.

807
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:47,400
You just said

808
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,400
you're not greedy

809
00:36:48,630 --> 00:36:50,290
and just want to make a profit.

810
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:52,150
For that reason alone,

811
00:36:52,630 --> 00:36:53,510
I won't let you

812
00:36:53,510 --> 00:36:54,480
invest.

813
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,320
Sit down first.

814
00:37:05,630 --> 00:37:07,360
I see where you're coming from.

815
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:09,740
You have no steady income,

816
00:37:10,070 --> 00:37:11,810
and the savings you have

817
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:12,840
are quite modest.

818
00:37:13,230 --> 00:37:15,440
So you dare not take risks.

819
00:37:17,190 --> 00:37:18,840
But I don't work with people

820
00:37:19,480 --> 00:37:21,070
