821
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:28,840
Qing is here.

822
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:34,550
Grandmother, Third Uncle, Little Aunt.

823
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:36,840
You're back. Take a seat.

824
00:37:41,110 --> 00:37:42,440
Is it your day off today?

825
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:43,280
Yes.

826
00:37:43,710 --> 00:37:45,880
I thought I'd come back to get some books.

827
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:47,540
You haven't eaten yet, right?

828
00:37:47,840 --> 00:37:48,510
Exactly.

829
00:37:49,030 --> 00:37:49,920
On my way here,

830
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:52,530
I thought about
grabbing a bite at your place.

831
00:37:53,030 --> 00:37:53,550
Hurry.

832
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:54,920
Take the newly delivered

833
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:56,360
meat-stuffed biscuits

834
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,620
and put them on a plate.

835
00:37:57,760 --> 00:37:59,320
Qing loves them.

836
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:00,070
Yes.

837
00:38:00,230 --> 00:38:01,400
Thank you, Grandmother.

838
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:02,330
You are the best.

839
00:38:02,590 --> 00:38:04,030
Come on, Third-Ranked Scholar,

840
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:05,510
you've only been working for a few days,

841
00:38:05,510 --> 00:38:07,280
and you've already learned
how to sweet-talk.

842
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:09,080
You must be joking, Little Aunt.

843
00:38:10,030 --> 00:38:11,760
You came back at the right time.

844
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:13,190
I was just about to

845
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:15,050
discuss it with your Third Uncle.

846
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:17,800
Now that you have a proper job,

847
00:38:18,230 --> 00:38:20,510
we should start preparing

848
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,500
for your wedding with Wanxue.

849
00:38:22,670 --> 00:38:25,070
How about setting it for
the end of the year?

850
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:26,870
The end of the year...

851
00:38:27,140 --> 00:38:28,400
might be a bit tight.

852
00:38:31,150 --> 00:38:32,150
Here is the thing.

853
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,550
The Imperial Court is sending envoys

854
00:38:33,550 --> 00:38:35,400
to negotiate peace with the Beiman.

855
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:37,400
The Hanlin Academy
also needs to send someone.

856
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,480
Today, I volunteered for the mission

857
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,610
with Scholar Chang.

858
00:38:39,800 --> 00:38:41,670
He said as long as you agree,

859
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:42,930
