860
00:38:44,230 --> 00:38:45,560
You are going to Beiman?

861
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:48,230
Beiman is so dangerous.

862
00:38:48,750 --> 00:38:50,410
Why are you going there?

863
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:52,400
Grandmother, please don't worry.

864
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:54,510
The Beiman envoys are coming this time.

865
00:38:54,510 --> 00:38:55,480
Our envoys

866
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:56,880
only need to go to Datong.

867
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:03,220
Why did you suddenly think

868
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:05,480
of getting involved in this matter?

869
00:39:05,510 --> 00:39:06,590
Are you unhappy

870
00:39:06,590 --> 00:39:07,850
in the Hanlin Academy?

871
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:09,320
I won't hide it from you, Third Uncle.

872
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:10,110
Working in the Hanlin Academy

873
00:39:10,110 --> 00:39:11,280
isn't unpleasant,

874
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,440
but too pleasant.

875
00:39:13,030 --> 00:39:14,150
Every day, I just compile books.

876
00:39:14,150 --> 00:39:15,150
And not too many.

877
00:39:15,550 --> 00:39:16,280
Compiling too much

878
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:17,880
will only make colleagues uncomfortable.

879
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:18,840
Submitting five entries a day

880
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:20,370
to the superiors is enough.

881
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:22,070
The rest of the time is spent reading

882
00:39:22,070 --> 00:39:23,150
and practicing calligraphy.

883
00:39:23,150 --> 00:39:24,480
Because of you, Third Uncle,

884
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:25,440
others treat me

885
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,550
very politely.

886
00:39:27,510 --> 00:39:28,710
I'm really afraid that after a few years

887
00:39:28,710 --> 00:39:29,770
of muddling along,

888
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:31,260
my drive will be worn away.

889
00:39:32,840 --> 00:39:34,240
You're getting anxious?

890
00:39:35,030 --> 00:39:35,630
Yes.

891
00:39:36,670 --> 00:39:37,280
Back then,

892
00:39:37,300 --> 00:39:38,760
you also transferred
from the Hanlin Academy

893
00:39:38,760 --> 00:39:40,490
to the Water Transport Office.

894
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:42,710
I intend to follow your example.

895
00:39:43,070 --> 00:39:43,710
I hope to be able

896
00:39:43,710 --> 00:39:45,230
to do some practical work.

897
00:39:47,550 --> 00:39:49,610
The peace talks with Beiman this time

898
00:39:49,800 --> 00:39:52,060
are highly valued by the Imperial Court.

899
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:54,440
If the talks are successful,

900
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:56,440
it will be a great achievement.

901
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,220
As a top-tier scholar,

902
00:39:58,800 --> 00:40:00,000
the Court will definitely entrust you

903
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:01,960
with heavy responsibilities
upon your return.

904
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,030
This is indeed faster than

905
00:40:03,030 --> 00:40:04,320
staying in the Hanlin Academy,

906
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:05,480
enduring step by step,

907
00:40:05,480 --> 00:40:07,080
and waiting for a promotion.

908
00:40:08,630 --> 00:40:10,230
Since you've made up your mind,

909
00:40:10,230 --> 00:40:11,030
then go ahead.

910
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:18,820
Thank you for your permission,
Third Uncle.

911
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:19,400
Sit.

912
00:40:23,630 --> 00:40:24,960
A trip to Datong

913
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:27,190
will take several months round trip.

914
00:40:27,190 --> 00:40:28,320
I'm afraid your marriage with Wanxue

915
00:40:28,320 --> 00:40:29,580
will be delayed again.

916
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:32,630
Let it be delayed.

917
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:35,090
Your future is more important.

918
00:40:39,190 --> 00:40:42,550
It really is "Regretting urging my husband
to seek official rank."

919
00:40:42,550 --> 00:40:43,320
Shut up.

920
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:47,340
Drink the soup.

921
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:50,810
It smells great.

922
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:12,360
Inside is a Duan inkstone

923
00:41:12,380 --> 00:41:13,780
and a box of Xuanyuan ink.

924
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,150
The ink is ordinary,

925
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:16,740
but this Duan inkstone

926
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,260
is an antique from the previous dynasty.

927
00:41:21,080 --> 00:41:23,060
I found it rustic and lovely,

928
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:24,980
so I am gifting it to you today.

929
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:41,000
Hearing that you don't have
to marry by the end of the year,

930
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:42,330
you look much brighter.

931
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:44,000
You talk too much.

932
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:45,880
Actually, I know.

933
00:41:46,150 --> 00:41:47,360
If it weren't Miss Yu,

934
00:41:47,400 --> 00:41:48,480
but Miss Gu,

935
00:41:48,670 --> 00:41:51,110
you definitely wouldn't want
to go to Shanxi.

936
00:41:51,110 --> 00:41:51,760
Yunting.

937
00:41:52,190 --> 00:41:53,120
If I ever hear you

938
00:41:53,590 --> 00:41:55,360
say such things again,

939
00:41:56,590 --> 00:41:58,520
you won't need to serve me anymore.

940
00:41:59,880 --> 00:42:00,760
I see.

941
00:42:01,110 --> 00:42:02,240
I won't say it again.

942
00:42:11,930 --> 00:42:14,370
[The Penal Court]

943
00:42:18,550 --> 00:42:19,350
Young Master.

944
00:42:19,360 --> 00:42:20,700
This is a servant from the Xue family

945
00:42:20,700 --> 00:42:21,760
delivering an invitation to you.

946
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:24,490
He has been waiting from the afternoon
until now.

947
00:42:24,630 --> 00:42:25,630
Which Xue family?

948
00:42:26,620 --> 00:42:28,150
[To Young Master Ye]

949
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:33,360
Xue Qinglan?

950
00:42:33,590 --> 00:42:34,230
Our lady

951
00:42:34,230 --> 00:42:36,230
would like to ask Your Highness
when you are free.

952
00:42:36,230 --> 00:42:38,030
She wants to invite you
to Linxia Restaurant for a drink.

953
00:42:38,030 --> 00:42:39,230
Invite me for a drink?

954
00:42:43,550 --> 00:42:44,680
Young Master Ye said

955
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:46,190
he's been busy with errands lately

956
00:42:46,190 --> 00:42:47,590
and can't spare any time.

957
00:42:51,480 --> 00:42:53,140
I want to hear his exact words.

958
00:42:54,480 --> 00:42:55,810
His exact words were...

959
00:42:56,320 --> 00:42:57,850
"She has too much free time.

960
00:42:57,920 --> 00:42:59,120
Tell her to get lost."

961
00:43:07,070 --> 00:43:08,110
Interesting.

962
00:43:08,960 --> 00:43:09,840
I haven't met

963
00:43:09,840 --> 00:43:12,170
such an interesting person in a long time.

964
00:43:14,530 --> 00:43:16,880
[The Reform of Land and Taxation]

965
00:43:18,960 --> 00:43:21,710
She said herself
that she doesn't have time to see me?

966
00:43:21,710 --> 00:43:23,510
Miss Qingpu passed the message.

967
00:43:23,550 --> 00:43:24,360
I suppose Miss Gu

968
00:43:24,360 --> 00:43:25,510
is busy with her business right now,

969
00:43:25,510 --> 00:43:26,320
so...

970
00:43:28,440 --> 00:43:30,070
She is mad at me

971
00:43:30,110 --> 00:43:31,510
about the Spring Outing.

972
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:35,510
By the way, Third Master.

973
00:43:35,510 --> 00:43:36,890
I heard a rumor

974
00:43:37,110 --> 00:43:38,840
that the family of the Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review,

975
00:43:38,840 --> 00:43:40,320
the Wangs, have taken a fancy to Miss Gu.

976
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:41,840
Wang Shenzhi's son,

977
00:43:41,840 --> 00:43:42,370
Wang Zan?

978
00:43:42,880 --> 00:43:43,320
Yes.

979
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:44,670
That Mr. Wang

980
00:43:44,670 --> 00:43:46,330
is telling everyone out there

981
00:43:46,590 --> 00:43:48,070
that Miss Gu is unreasonable.

982
00:43:47,950 --> 00:43:52,640
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

983
00:43:48,440 --> 00:43:49,630
If his grandmother wasn't

984
00:43:49,630 --> 00:43:51,480
old friends with
the Gu family's Old Madam,

985
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:53,230
he wouldn't even consider Miss Gu.

986
00:43:53,230 --> 00:43:54,510
To me,

987
00:43:54,630 --> 00:43:57,030
it sounds like
they are planning to propose.

988
00:43:57,030 --> 00:43:58,490
Wang Zan?

989
00:43:58,670 --> 00:43:59,960
Does he even deserve her?

990
00:43:59,960 --> 00:44:00,630
Exactly.

991
00:44:01,760 --> 00:44:02,560
Third Master,

992
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:04,920
we can't just let them propose, can we?

993
00:44:04,920 --> 00:44:05,550
Of course.

994
00:44:20,390 --> 00:44:24,000
[A Splendid Match]

